# This file is the SOURCE of the compiled English table: tools/gen_i18n.py turns it into build/i18n_en.c
# (const LangStrings lang_en_table) at build time; it is not read at run time and is not a language pack.
# Same format as lang/*.lang: "key = value" per line, keys are the LangStrings slots of include/types.inc
# in slot order (arrays numbered from 1), "..." keeps outer spaces, escapes \n \t \" \\, {version} = Duop version.
 	 " \, {version} = Duop version.
